      <p begin="03:38.460" end="03:40.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I feel it coming, babe (I feel it comin', baby)</p>
      <p begin="03:40.810" end="03:43.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I feel it coming (I feel it comin')</p>
